          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "13298796_0",
          "text": "<p>\r\n\tSuppose we have a statement a = if + 2 given to a C compiler for compilation. Which phase of the compiler will thrown an error for this:</p><br><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:10px;\">\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(A)</td><td>Lexical analyzer</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(B)</td><td>Syntax analyzer</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(C)</td><td>Semantic analyzer</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(D)</td><td>No error is thrown</td></tr>\n            </table>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "b",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.33",
          "tags": "Made Easy",
          "category": "Technical",
          "solution": "<p>\r\n\t(b)</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2859.png\" /></p>",
          "video": "https://player.vimeo.com/video/1034199020"
        },
        {
