          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "b",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.33",
          "tags": "Made Easy",
          "category": "Technical",
          "solution": "<p>\r\n\t(b)<br />\r\n\tPreprocessor &rarr; Substitution of macros<br />\r\n\tCompiler &rarr; Before execution/during compilation<br />\r\n\tAssembler &rarr; Translation of assembly code to machine dependent code</p>",
