        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "13298796_11",
          "text": "<p>\r\n\tConsider the following syntax directed translation:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2873.png\" /></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tIf the expression 16 # 12 & 4 # 16 & 12 # 4 & 2 is evaluated to 1024 then which of the following rule will be placed at <em>S</em><sub>1</sub>?</p><br><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:10px;\">\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(A)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2874.png\" /></p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(B)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2875.png\" /></p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(C)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2876.png\" /></p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(D)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<img style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" alt=\"\" src=\"assets/images_me25/img_2877.png\" /></p></td></tr>\n            </table>",
