          "text": "<p>\r\n\tConsider the following statements with respect to LR parsers:<br />\r\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> : To occur a conflict minimum 2 productions is required.<br />\r\n\t<em>S</em><sub>2</sub> : At least one of the production should to reduce.<br />\r\n\tWhich of the following is correct?</p><br><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:10px;\">\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(A)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>S</em><sub>2</sub> sufficient for conflict</p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(B)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> or <em>S</em><sub>2</sub> alone sufficient for conflict</p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(C)</td><td><p>\r\n\t<em>S</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>S</em><sub>2</sub> necessary to conflict</p></td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(D)</td><td>None of the above</td></tr>\n            </table>",
