          "text": "<p>\r\n\tWhich of the following is true?</p><br><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:10px;\">\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(A)</td><td>LR(k) is the most general back-tracking shift-reduces parsing method.</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(B)</td><td>LALR parser is most powerful and costly as compare to other parsers.</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(C)</td><td>Every SLR grammar is unambiguous but not every unambiguous grammar is SLR.</td></tr>\n                <tr><td style=\"width:30px; vertical-align:top;\">(D)</td><td>All CFG’s are LR and all LR grammar are unambiguous.</td></tr>\n            </table>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
