          "award": 2,
          "penalty": "0.66",
          "tags": "Made Easy",
          "category": "Technical",
          "solution": "<p>\r\n\t(c)<br />\r\n\t&bull; CLR is most powerful but LALR is most costly.<br />\r\n\t&bull; Every CFG is not LR since all LR are unambiguous but every CFG is not unambiguous.<br />\r\n\t&bull; LR(k) does not using back-tracking.<br />\r\n\t&bull; Every SLR grammar is unambiguous but not every unambiguous grammar is SLR.</p>",
