          "text": "<p>Assume ×, –, + and / are operators. Precedences and associativity given for those operators as following:<br />\r\n<strong>I.</strong> + has highest precedence among all operators and is right associative.<br />\r\n<strong>II.</strong> – has the next highest precedence among the remaining operators and is left associative.<br />\r\n<strong>III.</strong> ×, / are having equal precedence and are right associative.<br />\r\n+ → Multiplication<br />\r\n/ → Addition<br />\r\n× → Subtraction<br />\r\n– → Division<br />\r\nThe output of the given expression 3 × 2 + 10 + 5 – 7 × 6/3 is ________. (Upto 2 decimal places)</p>",
